    "detailed_description": "The one and only crowd simulation game, Crowd Playground!<br><br>'Crowd Playground', a crowd world building simulation game, is coming in 2022!<br>Chop, burn, and electrocute the crowds of zombies with traps,<br>wipe out the crowds of skeletons with the zombie cannon,<br>and you can even enjoy a harem of beautiful women, it's all up to you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What kind of game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build your own crowd world!<br>Choose from a collection of zombies, monsters, beautiful women, cannons, various traps, decorative objects, and more!<br>Other objects will be added and updated as we go!<br></li><li>Share your works and download maps created by others around the world!<br></li><li>Crowd AI can be changed! Choose from a selection of different character AIs!<br></li><li>I have developed the game alone!<br></li><li>This game really offers a unique crowd experience!</li></ul>",
